{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31389","headline":"牡丹 · 韩琮","name":"牡丹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桃时杏日不争浓，叶帐阴成始放红。\n晓艳远分金掌露，暮香深惹玉堂风。\n名移兰杜千年後，贵擅笙歌百醉中。\n如梦如仙忽零落，暮霞何处绿屏空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩琮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31389.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31389","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}